{"version":1,"key":"card:594","content":{"id":594,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"经常有这么一个场景，不同的人访问同一个 URL，服务器会返回不同的内容，比如根据所在的国家或地区返回不同的内容，这就意味着中间的缓存系统需要根据不同的国家和地区来对缓存进行区分，以保证能够正确的缓存内容。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"问题是缓存系统要如何知道根据哪些请求头加以区分呢？","bold":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"如果要比较所有的请求头，那么势必会导致缓存命中率急剧下降，缓存就没什么意义了，为了进行透明代理，服务需要指示缓存系统需要根据哪些请求头加以区分，它就是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Vary","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 响应头部。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Vary","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是一个 HTTP "},{"type":"formatted","text":"响应头部","bold":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，它的作用是指示缓存系统（如 CDN）或"},{"type":"formatted","text":"客户端（浏览器）","bold":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"应该根据哪些"},{"type":"formatted","text":"请求头部","bold":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"来判断是否可以复用缓存的响应。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"常见场景："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"根据不同的语言返回不同的内容"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"Vary: Accept-Language","language":"HTTP","uuid":"42dcfcbd-1cd1-483d-83e7-61b8f5368c0c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"根据不同的编码返回不同的压缩内容"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"Vary: Accept-Encoding","language":"HTTP","uuid":"795fedbd-39ee-493b-8e2e-a43c862b0592","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"根据不同的客户端返回不同的内容"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"Vary: User-Agent","language":"HTTP","uuid":"02186418-c3c3-4634-910c-abf917bd43e5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果需要区分多个首部，可以同时指定多个字段，字段之间使用逗号分隔"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"Vary: Accept-Encoding, Accept-Language","language":"HTTP","uuid":"5a5f5d87-d09e-4ebc-aa9b-26b723555db7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果缓存系统没有根据这些请求头加以区分，就会返回错误的缓存内容给用户。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"可见 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Vary","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 响应头对缓存系统有很大的影响，如果不正确的设置 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Vary","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 可能会导致缓存系统的成本上升、缓存命中率急剧下降或者返回错误的缓存响应，比如如果你不依赖于 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"User-Agent","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 提供不同的服务，却把 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"User-Agent","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 放入了 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Vary","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中，由于 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"User-Agent","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 高度离散，就会导致缓存效率大幅降低。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"参考："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"《HTTP 权威指南》，第 17 章，内容协商与转码"}]}]}]}],"tags":["HTTP/Vary"],"createTime":1752853058031,"updateTime":1752853182287,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1752853182287}}